  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Clean Edges After Printing"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "After supports are removed, printed parts may still have small burrs, seam lines, or rough edges along layer transitions. Unlike files or cutters that remove material across surfaces, a deburring tool follows edges and holes more smoothly, making it ideal for cleaning print seams, trimming borders, and smoothing the rims of printed holes for a more refined finish."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Four Blade Types for Different Trimming Tasks"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The kit includes four interchangeable blade types (BK1010 / BK3010 / BS2010 / BS1010). Each geometry is optimized for different scenarios, including straight edges, curved surfaces, and internal holes, handling a wide range of post‑processing tasks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Lightweight Aluminum Handle with Quick Change"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The anodized aluminum handle provides a lightweight yet durable grip for precise control. A tool-free quick‑change mechanism allows blades to be swapped instantly, helping you switch between trimming tasks effortlessly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Avoid using on soft material products (e.g., PVC, foam, soft plastics, etc.)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "After replacing the blade, ensure it is secure before use to prevent detachment and injury during operation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "It is recommended to push in one direction only, and avoid back-and-forth sawing motions."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "It is recommended to wear protective gloves during use, and keep the product away from children and pets."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "After use, promptly remove residue from the blade and handle, and store the blades in the storage case to prevent impact damage or corrosion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "For long-term storage, it is recommended to apply a thin layer of anti-rust oil and store in a dry place to extend service life."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: Center;\">Clean Edges After Printing</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">After supports are removed, printed parts may still have small burrs, seam lines, or rough edges along layer transitions. Unlike files or cutters that remove material across surfaces, a deburring tool follows edges and holes more smoothly, making it ideal for cleaning print seams, trimming borders, and smoothing the rims of printed holes for a more refined finish.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/b378c17395474e8a8ecbef234232af7a/11.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/b378c17395474e8a8ecbef234232af7a/11.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: Center;\">Four Blade Types for Different Trimming Tasks</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The kit includes four interchangeable blade types (BK1010 / BK3010 / BS2010 / BS1010). Each geometry is optimized for different scenarios, including straight edges, curved surfaces, and internal holes, handling a wide range of post‑processing tasks.</p>\n</div>\n<!--单开表格-->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\"><!--图片部分-->\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center; width: 100%;\"><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/b155f77927f243e5b4679dbe391b112c/Blade_Series.png\" height=\"640\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"1920\"/></p>\n<table class=\"pct_tb\"><!-- 参数部分 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr><!-- 表头内容支持修改 -->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Blade Model</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Dimensions (W × L × T)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Recommended Use</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Quantity</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 20%;\">BK1010</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">9 × 43 × 3.2 mm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">For fine edge trimming on most materials (e.g., Plastics, Wood, etc.)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">3 pcs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 20%;\">BK3010</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">9 × 42.5 × 3.2 mm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">For deburring small holes (e.g., 1.5 mm diameter) and tight internal edges</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">2 pcs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 20%;\">BS2010</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">11 × 47 × 3.2 mm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">For trimming copper, iron, and aluminum (reversible for double-sided use)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">3 pcs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 20%;\">BS1010</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">11 × 47 × 3.2 mm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">For light-duty trimming of plastic, aluminum, copper, and mild steel</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">2 pcs</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br/><br/><br/><!-- 第四条 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: Center;\">Lightweight Aluminum Handle with Quick Change</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The anodized aluminum handle provides a lightweight yet durable grip for precise control. A tool-free quick‑change mechanism allows blades to be swapped instantly, helping you switch between trimming tasks effortlessly.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br/><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" data-lazy=\"true\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/e908b49f5bde45a786406d26929b1fe0/3.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: cover;\" width=\"300\"></video></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-icpc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">In The Box</span></h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 171px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 27px; text-align: center;\">Item Name</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 27px; text-align: center;\">Professional Trimming Tool Kit</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 27px; text-align: center;\">Deburring Tool Handle</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 27px; text-align: center;\">Deburring Blades Set</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42; font-size: 14px;\"><b>Deburring Tool Handle </b></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">√</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">√ </span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">/</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42; font-size: 14px;\"><b>Deburring Blades Set</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">√</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">/</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">√</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 60px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<style>\n    .pct_hardware-tableList-t-icpc {\n        padding: '0 20px'\n    }\n\n    .pct_hardware-tableList {\n        width: 100%;\n        row-gap: 15px !important;\n        column-gap: 15px !important;\n    }\n\n    .pct_hardware-tableList .pct_ic-p {\n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .pct_hardware-tableList .pct_st-tbc .pct_tb .pct_td {\n        border-color: #ADADAD;\n    }\n\n    @media (min-width: 640px) {\n        .pct_hardware-tableList-t-icpc {\n            padding: 0px !important\n        }\n\n        .pct_hardware-tableList {\n            width: 100%;\n            row-gap: 15px;\n            column-gap: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .pct_hardware-tableList .pct_st-tbc .pct_tb .pct_td {\n            height: 50px;\n        }\n    }\n</style>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-icpc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_icpc pct_grad-2-pc pct_grad-1-mobile pct_hardware-tableList\"><!--左列表-->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 45%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Handle Material</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">Anodized Aluminum Alloy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Blade Material</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">HSS M2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Blade Thickness</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">0.2 mm (Tip) ~ 2 mm (Base)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右列表-->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 45%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Handle Dimensions</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">Ø18 mm (D) × 133 mm (L)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Max Cutting Width</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">2 ~ 3mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Blade Length</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">8 mm (BK series) / 13 mm (BS series)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--Considerations-->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 60px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Considerations</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 15px;\">Avoid using on soft material products (e.g., PVC, foam, soft plastics, etc.) .</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 15px;\">After replacing the blade, ensure it is secure before use to prevent detachment and injury during operation.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 15px;\">It is recommended to push in one direction only, and avoid back-and-forth sawing motions.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 15px;\">It is recommended to wear protective gloves during use, and keep the product away from children and pets.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 15px;\">After use, promptly remove residue from the blade and handle, and store the blades in the storage case to prevent impact damage or corrosion.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 15px;\">For long-term storage, it is recommended to apply a thin layer of anti-rust oil and store in a dry place to extend service life.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "After supports are removed, printed parts may still have small burrs, seam lines, or rough edges along layer transitions. Unlike files or cutters that remove material across surfaces, a deburring tool follows edges and holes more smoothly, making it ideal for cleaning print seams, trimming borders, and smoothing the rims of printed holes for a more refined finish.\n\nThe kit includes four interchangeable blade types (BK1010 / BK3010 / BS2010 / BS1010). Each geometry is optimized for different scenarios, including straight edges, curved surfaces, and internal holes, handling a wide range of post‑processing tasks.\n\nThe anodized aluminum handle provides a lightweight yet durable grip for precise control. A tool-free quick‑change mechanism allows blades to be swapped instantly, helping you switch between trimming tasks effortlessly.\n\nAvoid using on soft material products (e.g., PVC, foam, soft plastics, etc.).\n\nAfter replacing the blade, ensure it is secure before use to prevent detachment and injury during operation.\n\nIt is recommended to push in one direction only, and avoid back-and-forth sawing motions.\n\nIt is recommended to wear protective gloves during use, and keep the product away from children and pets.\n\nAfter use, promptly remove residue from the blade and handle, and store the blades in the storage case to prevent impact damage or corrosion.\n\nFor long-term storage, it is recommended to apply a thin layer of anti-rust oil and store in a dry place to extend service life.",
